    "created_at": "2023-02-16T01:58:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T01:58:45Z",
    "body": "HTTP 2616 allowed whitespace:\r\n\r\n|whitespace| supported by parse-single-range|\r\n|------------|----|\r\n| Before `=` |  ✅ |\r\n| After `=` |  ✅ |\r\n| Before `-` | ✅ |\r\n| After `-` | ✅ |\r\n| Before `,` | ❌ |\r\n| After `,` | ❌ |\r\n\r\nAdded some extra cases to https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/37569",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
